<#@ template language="C#" inherits="IntentTemplateBase<Intent.Modelers.Domain.ValueObjects.Api.ValueObjectModel>" #>
<#@ assembly name="System.Core" #>
<#@ import namespace="System.Collections.Generic" #>
<#@ import namespace="System.Linq" #>
<#@ import namespace="Intent.Modules.Common" #>
<#@ import namespace="Intent.Modules.Common.Templates" #>
<#@ import namespace="Intent.Metadata.Models" #>
<#@ import namespace="Intent.Modelers.Domain.ValueObjects.Api" #>
<#@ import namespace="Aryzac.GitHubIssues.Api" #>
---
id: <#= Model.Id #>
title: "task(value object): Introduce <#= Model.Name #> value object"
type: task
<# if (Model.HasGitHubIssueClosed()) { #>
closed: true
<# } else { #>
closed: false
<# } #>
---
<# if (Model.HasBusinessRequirement()) { #>

### Business Goal

<#= Model.GetBusinessRequirement().Summary() #>
<# if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Model.Comment)) { #>

<#= Model.Comment #>
<# } } #>

### Scope & Notes

| Attribute | Type | Nullable | Default | Description |
|-----------|------|----------|---------|-------------|
<# foreach (var attribute in Model.Attributes) { #>
| <#= attribute.Name #> | <#= GetTypeName(attribute.TypeReference) #> | <#= attribute.TypeReference.IsNullable ? "Yes" : "No" #> | <#= attribute.Value #> | <#= string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(attribute.Comment) ? "" : attribute.Comment #> |
<# } #>

Estimated Effort
Estimated Days: 0.25

| Task | Target Hours | Actual Hours |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Implement <Name>ValueObject | 0.5h | |
| Update consuming aggregate behaviour | 0.5h | |
| Adjust persistence configuration (if required) | 0.25h | |
| Documentation updates | 0.25h | |
| Buffer | 0.25h | |
| Total Target Hours | 1.75h (≈ 0.25 day) | |

Acceptance Checklist
- [ ] Value object class created and inherits from ValueObject
- [ ] Equality components include all invariant-driving fields
- [ ] Consuming aggregate updated to use the value object
- [ ] Persistence configuration updated or N/A documented
- [ ] Validation approach for value object usage recorded (automated or manual)
- [ ] Documentation updated (this recipe referenced)
- [ ] Effort variance >20% noted

<#+
string GetTypeName(ITypeReference tr)
{
    var name = tr.Element.Name;
    if (tr.IsCollection) name += " []";
    return name;
}
#>